  "label": {
    "en": [
      "The postcard displays a black-and-white photograph of a festive parade. A wagon festooned with foliage is being drawn by oxen through a city street. The wagon is carrying people in traditional European dress, and there is a crowd in the background. The buildings are old European style, and a shop sign reads 'AUGUST HEINRICH.' The bottom of the postcard contains the caption 'Jungfrauentag-Festwagen.'"
    ]
